{
  "schema_version": "3.0",
  "key": "short_explanation_opinion_writing",
  "concept_slug": "short_explanation_opinion_writing",
  "grounding_mode": "fallback_no_wiki",
  "title": "Write a Short Opinion with Clear Reasons",
  "cefr_level": "B1",
  "goal": "Write a short Norwegian opinion or explanation with a view, two reasons, linking phrases, and a brief closing sentence.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "orient",
      "title": "The Shape of a Short Opinion",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A short Norwegian opinion text works best when each sentence has a clear job. You first say what you think, then give one or two reasons, and finish with a brief closing idea."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use this simple order: opinion, reason one, reason two, closing sentence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg synes skoledagen bør starte litt senere."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I think the school day should start a little later."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Etter min mening er det viktig å ha tid til frokost."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "In my opinion, it is important to have time for breakfast."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A connector is a linking word or phrase. Connectors help the reader see the order and logic in your text."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "Start with Your View",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "To state your view, use a short opening phrase and then a complete sentence. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Jeg synes",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is direct and common. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "etter min mening",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is also useful when you want a slightly more careful opening."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "col_langs": [
            "no",
            "en",
            "no"
          ],
          "headers": [
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Opening"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Use"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Example"
              }
            ]
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Jeg synes"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "clear personal opinion"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Jeg synes norsk er nyttig i hverdagen."
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "etter min mening"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "personal opinion with a calm tone"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Etter min mening bør alle lære litt førstehjelp."
                }
              ]
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Jeg synes",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " can be followed directly by a full sentence: "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Jeg synes norsk er nyttig",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg synes det er bra å lese nyheter hver dag."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I think it is good to read news every day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Etter min mening bør vi bruke mindre plast."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "In my opinion, we should use less plastic."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Give Reasons and Link Them",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A reason explains why you think something. A clause is a part of a sentence with a verb. In Norwegian, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "fordi",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "siden",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " introduce reason clauses."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "fordi",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "siden",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " before the reason: "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Jeg liker byen fordi den har gode busser",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg vil sykle til jobb fordi det er billigere."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I want to bike to work because it is cheaper."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Siden været er fint, kan vi spise ute."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Since the weather is nice, we can eat outside."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "When you have two points, number them with "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "for det første",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "for det andre",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". These phrases make the structure easy to follow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "For det første sparer vi penger, og for det andre får vi mer mosjon."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "First, we save money, and second, we get more exercise."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "tip",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "After "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "for det første",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " or "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "for det andre",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": ", write a full point, not just a loose word."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "Make the Text Hold Together",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Coherence means that the ideas fit together and are easy to follow. In Norwegian, you can talk about this as "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "sammenheng",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". You create it by keeping one topic, using connectors, and ending with a sentence that points back to your main view."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A brief closing can repeat the main idea with "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "derfor",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "alt i alt",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Derfor mener jeg at flere bør reise med tog."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Therefore, I believe that more people should travel by train."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Alt i alt har teksten god sammenheng."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "All in all, the text has good coherence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Keep the closing short. It should not introduce a new reason; it should finish the thought you have already built."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
